  "body": "In https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/develop/development/synapse_architecture/faster_joins.html, there's a mention of \"MSC706\". Two issues with this bit:\r\n\r\n* The link goes to MSC3902, which is already linked to in the line above\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/706 does not seem to be an MSC, it looks like that bit too is a typo meant to refer to MSC3706 instead?",
